[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Silence the Cannons</h2>
<i>"I've always wondered why don't people just aim their cannons over a sun barricade"<br>
--Palen Greg a Nimbian Scientist</i>  
<p>Silence, a sneaky general who has won many battle through his cunning.  Now you are trapped!  Your foe quickly encircled your island and begun his attack.  You must survive his attack and show that you are far more cunning than he is.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
Silence is defeated!  Many clans have been destroyed or captured, but you still have survived.  It will not be long now till the winner of this contest is decided.

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron61

[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from Silence</h2>
<p>
What??  You're in for it now!!

[ai2TempleDead]
<h2>Message from Silence</h2>
<p>
NOOOO!!!!

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from Silence</h2>
<p>
Get your hands off me!

[ai3TempleDead]
<h2>Message from the Dean</h2>
<p>I have failed!


[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from Stewart of Thunder</h2>
<p>
Hey!  Leave my Temple alone!

[ai6TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Govener of Sun</h2>
<p>
I need help here!

[ai6PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Govener of Sun has died!</h2>
<p>
Overwhelmed by enemy forces the Govener of Sun perished, you soon shared his fate.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai7TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Govener of Sun</h2>
<p>Looks like our friend is being overwhelmed!  We must try to help him!

[ai7PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Knight of Wind has died!</h2>
<p>
The Knight of Wind has been slain!  Without the Knight's presence, the rest of Silence's forces advance on your position and your fate left in Silence's hands.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai8PriestDead]
<h2>A message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
We shall get you out of this prediciment yet!

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
The Knight of Wind and Govener of Suns efforts to save you were in naught.  They live to see another day, but you have died in battle.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]


